{"server":"tw","storyId":"act10d5_level_act10d5_st01","groupId":"act10d5","stageId":null,"title":"習慣","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act10d5/level_act10d5_st01.txt","sourceHash":"421c0c3681d524ae9e654c6cd6d5e713910b707064416f2bed57f1953b5ff176","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"堅雷指出古米攻擊時的奇怪習慣，古米嘗試克服，卻沒能成功。\n她的習慣都是過去經歷留下的疤痕，想要淡化，或許還需要一點點時間。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"古米 习惯"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米是宿舍裡第二個醒來的人，她有個習慣。\n一旦被真理叫醒，她就會握握真理的手，然後用同樣的方法到隔壁去叫醒凜冬。\n至於凜冬握不握她的手，純看“冬將軍”醒來時的心情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"6:30 a.m.\n羅德島宿舍區  真理與古米的宿舍"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（早上到了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（唔，真理姐應該快來了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（真理姐今天好慢啊，是最近太累了嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（但再等下去的話早上勤務就要遲到了，別再等真理姐了，快起來吧古米。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（你做得到的，古米，加油！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......唔唔，嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我起來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好黑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"小夜燈怎麼關了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"真理姐？真理姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，是出門了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"過去看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不在呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是真的急著出門吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"“古米，今天有事出門，晚上才回來，自己照顧好自己。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"“真理——”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"“——和凜冬。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，又把我當小孩子看待，我當然能照顧好自己啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"原來凜冬姐也起床了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，時候不早了，得趕快去報到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"平底鍋要帶好，還有硬梆梆的盾牌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好，準備完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"出發！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:28 a.m.\n羅德島食堂   料理區"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"有點餓了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"早上走得太急，沒來得及填飽肚子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"還是先專心幹活吧，幹完就能吃飯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"這鍋菜好了，請放到取餐區去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"下一鍋是上湯澆菜嗎，好，加油！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"這鍋菜好了，請放到取餐區去!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"下一鍋是......唔，還有一份油炸肉餃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那等人來把菜放到取餐區去，回來繼續燒個菜，早上的活就算幹完啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，我忙不過來了！你能自己把菜送過去嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，沒盾牌重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"是送到哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"堅雷教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"堅雷教官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"今天大家怎麼動作都這麼快？一回頭人就不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我直接問取餐區的人好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"應該就是這裡了吧，今天負責收銀的是——遠山姐姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"遠山姐姐，您好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"中午好，小熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼拿著鍋子就出來了，要我搭把手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了姐姐，您告訴古米應該把菜放到哪裡就好，再這樣懸著，菜都要涼啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"這是上湯澆菜吧，如果我沒記錯，應該是中間，訊使站著的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不用幫把手嗎，小熊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不用不用，再見遠山姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑點","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"別看了，拿不動的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎，今天想來點什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"野菜扣肉，好的，清炒時蔬再加個燉蛋，沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"來，請您拿好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"小心燙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，再見~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"訊使哥哥，菜來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"哦好，謝謝你古米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"喝！好，完工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思古米，能麻煩你把鍋帶回去嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好的訊使哥哥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咕嚕————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"真是辛苦你了，來，哥哥這裡有塊餅乾，拿去墊墊肚子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝訊使哥哥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"訊使","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣，記得忙完了以後好好吃飯哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"再見遠山姐姐，我回去幹活了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遠山","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"路上當心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咕嚕嚕————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（馬上就能吃飯了，再忍一小會。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"好吃的我來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊啊小刻你不能進去！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"不行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！你看到門上那個貼紙了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"一個紅的圓圈裡有根斜著的紅線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"還有小刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"這是“小刻禁止入內”的意思，明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"明白為什麼還要往裡面走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"餓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"餓了可以去那邊排隊買東西吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"餓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"總，總之，小刻不能進去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"餓了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好古米想想辦法！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"如果古米把這塊餅乾給你，你能答應古米不進去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"好的好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"給......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......終於走了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咕嚕嚕嚕————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，還有活要幹，只剩一個菜了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"再熬一下，一下就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咕嚕嚕嚕嚕————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"飯勺好重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"鏟不動菜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不行了，古米也要吃東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米有個習慣，如果餓壞了\n會不受控制地找東西吃\n什麼都吃"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鈷眯妮撍嚒惹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"軟軟的，呼呼，一定很好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊嗚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"古米你咬我腰幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，呃，唔唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起教官！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:55 a.m.\n羅德島食堂   用餐區"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（吞食麵包）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（一口悶湯）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不急啊，古米，慢慢吃，下午還要訓練呢，啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（光碟行動）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（再來一份）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"古米？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（橫掃千食）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"看來現在不太方便打擾她呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"等一會好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊，終於活過來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"教官，你不餓嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"餓啊，只是我剛把吃的拿過來，就到你肚子裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起教官！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，我再去拿就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你怎麼會餓成這樣，早飯沒好好吃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"今天早上醒晚了，沒來得及吃飽，所以就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊，或許是那種吃不飽的類型哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，就像那邊那個一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻怎麼又開始往廚房衝了？！我得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，廚房有人專門負責盯著她，門口也專門放了些好吃的來做緩衝，就算溜進去，也沒多大影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為廚房門口的零食籃是給大家上崗前充饑用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"也有這部分因素在內吧，只要達到效果就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"看，這不是出來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"要是把那扇門封死，她肯定會很傷心的，偶爾讓她進進門，享受一下勝利，刻俄柏就添不了太多麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那，門口負責看著她的是誰呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的話，遠山吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，遠山姐姐的話的確是什麼都能預料到呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我有個問題想問問你，和下午的訓練也有些關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，您問吧教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像沒辦法連續快速地揮動手臂呢，能告訴我原因嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"實戰的時候也是，在廚房做切配的時候也是，只要揮兩下手就會頓住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是......習慣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"習慣——嗎。這可不是個好習慣，能試著矯正一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"戰場上出現停頓可是會致命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你能克服這個問題的話，下一屆羅德島切配大賽的冠軍頭銜說不定就是你的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不嘗試一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"試試......看吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那下午重裝幹員培訓結束以後我們試試看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能矯正，有沒有效果到時候再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"先填飽肚子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"narration","text":"3:00  p.m.\n羅德島訓練中心   重裝幹員訓練室"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這是今天最後的訓練了，各位堅持一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"平板支撐四組，計時——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"開始！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"還有十秒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"三，二，一！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"結束！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的訓練到此全部完成，各位可以去休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重裝幹員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"耶！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"古米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"在，教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"有時間嗎，我們試一下中午說的事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好的教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那我去拿訓練盾，你用你順手的武器就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"放鬆些，這樣能對你恢復有所幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好了古米，接下來你要試著用全力攻擊我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道剛剛訓練完肯定很累，但就是這種時候才能對你有幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，來，把剩下的力氣全用出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"再來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哈呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"再來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"再來，不許停！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"再來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果是條件反射和肌肉控制剛剛那幾下應該揮下來了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（自己無意識收住了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（為什麼？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，揮下來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"教官我做不到！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"揮啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的不行！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這是命令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"古米！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我命令你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米是個料理好手，她有個習慣。\n切東西時只切兩下。如果第三刀切下去——\n會把砧板連廚房桌面一起砍斷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，哈，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，沒事沒事，好久沒有挨這麼重的衝擊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是你的習慣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起教官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，我一點事都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"只是你這個問題，好像還有點複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"第三下揮擊你會下意識用盡全力，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"第四下應該也是揮不出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那一下要是在廚房，砧板可能都要被切成兩段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"本來以為只是克服一個關卡的問題，這個......還真有點麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"看來是我太心急了，對不起，古米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒，沒有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"是我給教官添麻煩了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"解散吧，你可以回去好好休息了，後面的事情我再想想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果還想嘗試一下的話，可以隨時來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"再見教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，拜拜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（好麻。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊啊啊好麻好麻。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯童子軍力氣怎麼那麼大啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（該去醫療部和嘉維爾聊聊天了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（順便帶點吃的給她。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"4:30 p.m.\n羅德島宿舍區   凜冬、真理與古米的宿舍"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米一個人回到了宿舍。\n古米沒有開燈。\n古米把“盾牌”支在牆角。\n古米鑽了進去。\n古米什麼都沒有做錯。\n古米只是覺得難過。\n古米想做得更好，大家也一直在幫助古米。\n古米失敗了。\n自從來到羅德島，古米多了很多“習慣”。\n古米也知道其中一些可能會給別人帶來困擾。\n但古米改變不了。\n古米改變不了“古米”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米有個習慣。\n無論去哪裡，她都會帶上小金庫門和平底鍋。\n古米有個習慣。\n牙膏用到最後一點，要用嘴吸出來塗在牙齒上。\n古米有個習慣。\n站在高處的時候，絕對要和邊緣保持距離，即使那裡有欄杆保護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米有個習慣。\n餓壞的時候，會控制不住地去咬最近的東西，如果沒有，就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米有個習慣。\n如果在黑漆漆的地方待久了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你已經回來了嗎古米，怎麼不開燈？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......但是。\n古米有個習慣。\n在看到凜冬和真理的時候，所有習慣都不再是習慣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"大概又碰到什麼事情一個人窩在牆角難過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（哭腔）我沒有！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唉真是難辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，收拾一下，一會烈夏就要來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好的凜冬姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"喏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，過來一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"來了凜冬姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬姐古米會自己擦的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"別動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，一會手帕洗乾淨還給真理，知道嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，怎麼回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（噓——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，沒什麼問的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"幹活吧古米，東西買好了，剩下的就交給你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，今天是什麼特別的日子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"今天是我們來到羅德島整一年的紀念日，凜冬也好不容易早起了，很難得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——好累，我躺一會，人來了記得叫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"起來，還有很多事情要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，用一下那個吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"真的要用那個嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我先去分一下飲料和食品，把凜冬拖起來的任務就交給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬姐~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米最——喜歡凜冬姐了~~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"別說這些肉麻的，我要休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬姐~嘿嘿~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"別壓我身上啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"撓撓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我起來，我起來！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"真理姐完工了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"好，讓她來幹活，我這兒東西還挺多的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，為什麼我又要提袋子又要工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"當領袖就是要多做事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣哦，嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——麻煩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"門開著，進來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你來了啊，幫忙拿一下，東西有點多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"全部處理完就能好好慶祝一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"虧你還記得這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"哦噢，這是？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是我最喜歡吃的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"但我記得這不便宜吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"別管那麼多，今天我請客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，多謝啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"別傻站著，快來幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"這個是放這裡是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我剛拿過去的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米有個習慣。\n開心，就會笑。\n發自內心的笑。\n古米希望大家都能這樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"弄完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬，說些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼什麼，吃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"烏拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"烏拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"烏拉！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"烏拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（大家好久沒有一起聚了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（希望下一次早露姐姐也能參加進來。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"進來吧，門沒關。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"（探頭張望）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"小熊在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"小熊你在啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"你好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"中午吃了你的餅乾，現在來還你一塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"火神大姐教我做的，剛剛做完就送過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是......有點大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"快吃吧，冷了就不好吃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"拜拜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"走掉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"char_194_rosali","isRemote":false,"text":"這是（烏薩斯驚歎詞）餅乾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"她說是就是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"愣著幹嘛，吃啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（今晚能把肚子塞飽了呢。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（真好。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"9:00 p.m.\n羅德島宿舍區   凜冬、真理與古米的宿舍"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼，好開心啊，但是該睡覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"打開我親愛的小夜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉？怎麼開不了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是燈管壞了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說來，早上就沒有亮欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那時候就壞了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米有個習慣\n晚上睡覺的時候一定要把小夜燈打開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"古米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了真理姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天可以一起睡嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天凜冬姐也在這裡休息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我說啊，真理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"古米的床真能三個人一起睡嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"擠一擠就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那古米要被擠成小熊餅乾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"古米沒問題的凜冬姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那好吧，如果覺得悶或者熱，你和我說，我回去睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我關燈了，晚安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"晚安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們上次窩在一起睡覺是什麼時候來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不記得了，不想記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也想不起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就當我多嘴，睡了睡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙這麼快就能睡著嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"古米？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Zzzzzz......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原來閉上眼睡不著的只有我一個啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不想了，明天還要忙半天，煩死人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（嘻嘻~）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（凜冬姐真可愛。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（晚安~）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"古米有個習慣。\n......\n自治團的烏薩斯們，\n凜冬和真理，\n就是古米的習慣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_109_fmout","aliases":["遠山"]},{"speakerId":"char_115_headbr","aliases":["凜冬"]},{"speakerId":"char_194_rosali","aliases":["烈夏"]},{"speakerId":"char_195_glassb","aliases":["真理"]},{"speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","aliases":["古米"]},{"speakerId":"char_198_blackd","aliases":["訊使"]},{"speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","aliases":["刻俄柏"]},{"speakerId":"char_260_durnar","aliases":["堅雷"]},{"speakerId":"ch